   "fix": "Add `lemma timeComponent_sub {d : \u2115} (u v : Vector d) : (u - v).timeComponent = u.timeComponent - v.timeComponent` next to `timeComponent_add`/`spatialPart_sub`, with the same non-`@[simp]` note, and list it in the module docstring bullet at line 20.",
   "issue": "The PR adds `timeComponent_add`, `spatialPart_add` and already had `spatialPart_sub`, but there is no `timeComponent_sub`. The new `InvariantMass` lemmas all require `hq : q.timeComponent = \u03b3.energy`; for the canonical photon `PhotonKinematics.ofEmission p p'` (Kinematics/Basic.lean:131, energy `p.timeComponent - p'.timeComponent`, four-momentum `q = p - p'`) discharging that hypothesis needs exactly `(p - p').timeComponent = p.timeComponent - p'.timeComponent`, which no declaration provides.",
